# Vercel Blob — where the roster (db.json) and its automatic backups live.
#
# On Vercel: create a Blob store (Storage -> Create -> Blob) and connect it to
# the project. Vercel injects this variable automatically; you do not set it by
# hand there.
#
# Locally: copy this file to .env.local and paste the token from the Blob
# store's ".env.local" tab, or run `vercel env pull .env.local`.
#
# Without it the app still runs, but the roster is kept only in the current
# browser and the header shows "This device only".
BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=
